  "title": "Protein Optimization 103: Racing to the Top 100",
  "summary": "What a close race this one was! In this blog post, we look at how submissions evolved throughout our latest EGFR binder design competition. We highlight the most widespread model and design choices, how some people exploited loopholes in our scoring system, and argue if de novo design is reliable or not. We also have plenty of animations for you to click through!",
